px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px\">Think Your Non-Compete Doesn\u2019t Matter? Think Again.</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Hi </span>Sara,</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Let\u2019s talk about the number one clause that gets glossed over, shrugged off, and misunderstood in nearly every deal I touch: the non-compete.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Every day, I hear some version of: <em>\u201cNon-competes aren\u2019t enforceable, right? So who cares?\u201d</em></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Oh, just the buyer, the seller, the bank, and your entire deal. That\u2019s who.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The Non-Compete Myth That Won\u2019t Die</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Thanks to headlines (and let\u2019s be honest, a few clickbaity TikToks), people think non-competes are dead. But here\u2019s the truth: they\u2019re very much alive\u2014especially when you\u2019re buying or selling a business.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Even when the FTC tried to come for them, they carved out a big juicy exception for business sales. Why? Because you can\u2019t buy an accounting firm and then let the seller open a competing firm across the street the next day. That's not a business deal. That's a mess.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Where Your Non-Compete Lives Matters</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">It\u2019s not just <em>what</em> your non-compete says, but <em>where</em> it lives. Stick it in the wrong agreement\u2014say, a consulting agreement instead of a purchase agreement\u2014and you may find out the hard way it doesn\u2019t hold up.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">And don\u2019t forget:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Geographic scope</strong> needs to be defined (50 miles from where, exactly?)</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Time frame</strong> needs to make sense (hint: 5 years might not cover a 10-year SBA loan)</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Actual clarity</strong> matters (your lawyer should be able to look at it and say, \u201cYes, you can do this\u201d or \u201cNo, you absolutely cannot\u201d)</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">But Wait, There\u2019s More (Nuance)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Let\u2019s say your seller still wants to do their grandkid\u2019s taxes. Or help their favorite client until one of them dies (yes, that\u2019s a real quote I\u2019ve heard). That\u2019s fine. Just write it down. Include exceptions. Carve it out. Make it clear.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Because a good non-compete shouldn\u2019t feel like a straitjacket. It should feel like a well-fitting suit. Fits like a glove.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Want to stop treating your non-compete like fine print and start using it like a power move?</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/db63b1ec3e2?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;si=eYzICE_8jRPU_jJj&amp;utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email marketing\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204); color: rgb(17, 85, 204); color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><u>Click here to learn exactly how to draft one </u></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">that holds up and keeps your deal clean.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">To smarter deals (and fewer legal regrets),<br>Sara Sharp<br>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Founder, Deal Academy</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">P.S. If you\u2019ve got an upcoming transaction and you\u2019re not sure if your non-compete is worth the paper it\u2019s printed on, </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/21d70125604?co